  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC05_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "We need to get work gathering Component Parts from Gearheads. You should be heading to Marleybone!",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Frog_Balestrom_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ProfHalstonBalestrom_QST_67.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38141,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC05_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Good to see you once more, my fine pupil! I see from my records that you're just now due to learn a spell more powerful than any you've learnt thus far. It's the Storm Lord spell I speak of...  summoning a Storm Titan to do your bidding! \\n",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Frog_Balestrom_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ProfHalstonBalestrom_QST_68.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38141,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC05_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "First, though, you'll need to build a device capable of harnessing the power of the Storm Lord. The device is called the Oscillation Overthruster. It can pierce the veil of reality and invoke a Storm Lord for you to bargain with!",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Frog_Balestrom_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ProfHalstonBalestrom_QST_69.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38141,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC05_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "First we'll start with the raw materials. That's the easy part. I need you to go to Marleybone and collect Component Parts from Gearheads.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Frog_Balestrom_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ProfHalstonBalestrom_QST_70.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38141,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC05_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Those Component Parts look like they've been through a wringer, but they'll still work. Wonderful work!",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Frog_Balestrom_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ProfHalstonBalestrom_QST_71.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 38141,
